          <td class="col">
            <p class='mb-1' style="word-break: break-word;">
                MOTION for Leave to File Amicus Brief in Support of Plaintiff and in Opposition to Defendant&#x27;s Motion to Dismiss filed by U.S. Equal Employment Opportunity Commission. (Attachments: # 1 Amicus Brief, # 2 Proposed Order granting Motion to File Amicus Brief)(Winkelman, Steven) (Filed on 4/9/2024) (Entered: 04/09/2024)
                
                    
                        <p class="mb-0 mt-2">
                            1 Amicus Brief
